<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1000Y_S0012" variety="S0012">
<name>SRS Airbag</name>
<ttl id="1000Y_S0012_745Q2_T00B8" variety="T00B8">
<name>SRS Airbag System</name>
<para id="RM000000ELV00JX" category="C" type-id="305EB" name-id="554HF-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B1832</dtccode>
<dtcname>Curtain shield airbag RH ignition circuit (short to ground)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000ELV00JX_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00006FV00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The curtain shield airbag RH squib circuit consists of the airbag computer assembly and curtain shield airbag RH. When the activation conditions are met, the curtain shield airbag RH is activated.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When a short to ground is detected in the curtain shield airbag RH squib circuit (ICR+, ICR- lines), DTC B1832 is stored in the airbag computer assembly.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.020989     in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="2.9949     in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="3.131031     in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Trouble Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1832</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Short to ground in ICR+, ICR- lines of the wire harness between the airbag computer assembly and curtain shield airbag RH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Curtain shield airbag RH malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly Malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Floor wire No.2 (between airbag computer assembly and curtain shield airbag RH)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Curtain Shield Airbag RH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELV00JX_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00006FW00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C159578J04" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELV00JX_07" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00006FX00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>When performing the problem reproduction method, select test mode using TaSCAN first. (see <xref href="RM00000050J01GX" label="Seep01"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELV00JX_08" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___00006FY00000">
<testtitle>Connector Inspection</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the battery negative terminal and wait for 90 seconds.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Before disconnecting the cable from the negative battery terminal, check that the ignition switch is off.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the connection condition of the connectors connected to the airbag computer assembly and curtain shield airbag RH.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>The connector is connected properly</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connectors connected to the airbag computer assembly and curtain shield airbag RH, and check the condition of the terminals of each connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>The terminals are not deformed or damaged</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the condition of the short pins of the connectors with a short mechanism on floor wire No.2.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>The short pins are not deformed or damaged</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0011" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0017" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0011" proc-id="RM0550J___00006FZ00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Curtain Shield Airbag RH Squib Circuit (Airbag Computer Assembly - Curtain Shield Airbag RH)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref href="RM0000005D701ZX" label="Seep01"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of connector C and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C135588J08" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<table>
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.19in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.98in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2 (ICR+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1M Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 (ICR-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1M Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0012" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0017" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___00006G000000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the connector to the airbag computer assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C135589J03" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using a wire harness (wire diameter 0.5mm), connect the terminals of connector C.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>When connecting the terminals, do not forcibly insert the wire harness into the connector terminals.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery negative terminal, turn IG ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0013" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___00006G100000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Inspect Airbag Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref href="RM00000050J01GX" label="Seep01"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC B1832 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC B1832 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0014" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0018" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0014" proc-id="RM0550J___00006G200000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146188J08" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the battery negative terminal and wait for 90 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the wire between the terminals of connector C, and connect the connector to the curtain shield airbag RH.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery negative terminal, turn IG ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0015" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0015" proc-id="RM0550J___00006G300000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Inspect Curtain Shield Airbag RH Squib System</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref href="RM00000050J01GX" label="Seep01"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC B1832 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC B1832 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0016" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0019" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0016">
<testtitle>Perform Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0017">
<testtitle>Replace Floor Wire NO.2</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0018">
<testtitle>Replace Airbag Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002RR0002X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELV00JX_08_0019">
<testtitle>Replace Curtain Shield Airbag Assembly RH<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFQ00AX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
